lot-claimants note: NARA series that claim a FRUS lot number, for the lots where more than one does. NARA divides lot files across series and consolidates several into one, so a lot with several claimants has several correct answers; Source Explorer shows them as candidates rather than picking. Built offline from the record-group harvest with the app's own LotResolutionAcceptance rule.
